{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-2592" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the integral of $\\frac{z+5}{\\sqrt{z+4}}.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/state.json" "file_sha256" "afcab72d64b527cbd2225ff0fdf2c82f9251019fbcfe78ada30e35b0c0864f92"} {"question" "q-2592" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let $u=z+4.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}z}=1\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}z=\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nWe also note that\n$z+5=u+1.$\n\nNow we can solve the integral in terms of $u,$ and then express our final answer in terms of $z:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{z+5}{\\sqrt{z+4}}\\,\\text{d}z & =\\int \\frac{u+1}{\\sqrt{u}}\\,\\text{d}z \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{u}{\\sqrt{u}}+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u}}\\,\\text{d}z \\\\  & =\\int \\sqrt{u}\\,\\text{d}u+\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\int {u}^{1/2}\\,\\text{d}u+\\int {u}^{-1/2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{2{u}^{3/2}}{3}+2\\sqrt{u}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\sqrt{(z+4)^{3}}}{3}+2\\sqrt{z+4}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/state.json" "file_sha256" "afcab72d64b527cbd2225ff0fdf2c82f9251019fbcfe78ada30e35b0c0864f92"} {"question" "q-2592" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "62ae727eded295afdb64307ce0294ab3c89743fdff2710a749a2ef6120de1370"} {"question" "q-2592" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/state.json" "file_sha256" "afcab72d64b527cbd2225ff0fdf2c82f9251019fbcfe78ada30e35b0c0864f92"} {"question" "q-2592" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{2\\sqrt[3]{(z+4)^{2}}}{3}+\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{z+4}}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{2\\sqrt[3]{(z+4)^{2}}}{3}+\\sqrt{z+4}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{2\\sqrt{(z+4)^{3}}}{3}+2\\sqrt{z+4}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{(z+4)^{2}}}{3}+2\\sqrt{z+4}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{\\sqrt{(z+4)^{3}}}{2}+\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{z+4}}+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/state.json" "file_sha256" "afcab72d64b527cbd2225ff0fdf2c82f9251019fbcfe78ada30e35b0c0864f92"} {"question" "q-2592" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{2\\sqrt{(z+4)^{3}}}{3}+2\\sqrt{z+4}+C"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/state.json" "file_sha256" "afcab72d64b527cbd2225ff0fdf2c82f9251019fbcfe78ada30e35b0c0864f92"} {"question" "q-2615" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate the integral $\\int {x}^{2}\\sqrt{1-x}\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/state.json" "file_sha256" "afcab72d64b527cbd2225ff0fdf2c82f9251019fbcfe78ada30e35b0c0864f92"} {"question" "q-2615" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let $u=1-x.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=-1\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=-\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nWe also note that\n$x=1-u.$\n\nNow we can solve the integral in terms of $u,$ and then express our final answer in terms of $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {x}^{2}\\sqrt{1-x}\\,\\text{d}x & =-\\int (1-u)^{2}\\sqrt{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\int ({u}^{2}-2u+1)\\sqrt{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\int ({u}^{5/2}-2{u}^{3/2}+{u}^{1/2})\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-(\\frac{2}{7}{u}^{7/2}-\\frac{4}{5}{u}^{5/2}+\\frac{2}{3}{u}^{3/2})+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{7}\\sqrt{(1-x)^{7}}+\\frac{4}{5}\\sqrt{(1-x)^{5}}-\\frac{2}{3}\\sqrt{(1-x)^{3}}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/state.json" "file_sha256" "afcab72d64b527cbd2225ff0fdf2c82f9251019fbcfe78ada30e35b0c0864f92"} {"question" "q-2615" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "62ae727eded295afdb64307ce0294ab3c89743fdff2710a749a2ef6120de1370"} {"question" "q-2615" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/state.json" "file_sha256" "afcab72d64b527cbd2225ff0fdf2c82f9251019fbcfe78ada30e35b0c0864f92"} {"question" "q-2615" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-\\frac{2}{5}\\sqrt{{x}^{9}}+\\frac{2}{7}\\sqrt{{x}^{3}}-\\frac{5}{3}\\sqrt{{x}^{3}}+C"] ["math" "-\\frac{2}{7}\\sqrt{(1-x)^{7}}+\\frac{4}{5}\\sqrt{(1-x)^{5}}-\\frac{2}{3}\\sqrt{(1-x)^{3}}+C"] ["math" "-\\frac{2}{7}\\sqrt{(1-x)^{7}}-\\frac{4}{5}\\sqrt[5]{(1-x)^{4}}+\\sqrt{(1-x)^{3}}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{2{x}^{2}}{7}-{x}^{2}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{2}{7}\\sqrt[5]{(1-x)^{7}}+\\frac{4}{5}\\sqrt[5]{(1-x)^{4}}-\\frac{2}{3}\\sqrt[5]{(1-x)^{2}}+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/state.json" "file_sha256" "afcab72d64b527cbd2225ff0fdf2c82f9251019fbcfe78ada30e35b0c0864f92"} {"question" "q-2615" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-\\frac{2}{7}\\sqrt{(1-x)^{7}}+\\frac{4}{5}\\sqrt{(1-x)^{5}}-\\frac{2}{3}\\sqrt{(1-x)^{3}}+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/state.json" "file_sha256" "afcab72d64b527cbd2225ff0fdf2c82f9251019fbcfe78ada30e35b0c0864f92"} {"question" "q-49386" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Given that $u=x-1$, which integral is equivalent to $\\int x\\sqrt[5]{x-1}\\,\\text{d}x?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/state.json" "file_sha256" "afcab72d64b527cbd2225ff0fdf2c82f9251019fbcfe78ada30e35b0c0864f92"} {"question" "q-49386" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Since $u=x-1,$ then, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=1\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nWe also note that\n$x=u+1.$\n\nNow we can rewrite the integral in terms of $u:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x\\sqrt[5]{x-1}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (u+1)(\\sqrt[5]{u})(\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\int (u+1)({u}^{1/5})(\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\int ({u}^{6/5}+{u}^{1/5})\\text{d}u\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/state.json" "file_sha256" "afcab72d64b527cbd2225ff0fdf2c82f9251019fbcfe78ada30e35b0c0864f92"} {"question" "q-49386" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "62ae727eded295afdb64307ce0294ab3c89743fdff2710a749a2ef6120de1370"} {"question" "q-49386" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/state.json" "file_sha256" "afcab72d64b527cbd2225ff0fdf2c82f9251019fbcfe78ada30e35b0c0864f92"} {"question" "q-49386" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\int ({u}^{1/5}+{u}^{-1/5})\\text{d}u"] ["math" "\\int ({u}^{6/5}+{u}^{1/5})\\text{d}u"] ["math" "\\int ({u}^{6/5}-{u}^{1/5})\\text{d}u"] ["math" "\\int {u}^{1/5}\\,\\text{d}u"] ["math" "\\int {u}^{6/5}\\,\\text{d}u"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/state.json" "file_sha256" "afcab72d64b527cbd2225ff0fdf2c82f9251019fbcfe78ada30e35b0c0864f92"} {"question" "q-49386" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\int ({u}^{6/5}+{u}^{1/5})\\text{d}u"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/state.json" "file_sha256" "afcab72d64b527cbd2225ff0fdf2c82f9251019fbcfe78ada30e35b0c0864f92"} {"question" "q-49533" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Given that $u=5x-3$, which integral is equivalent to ${\\int }_{0}^{2}x\\sqrt{5x-3}\\,\\text{d}x?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/state.json" "file_sha256" "afcab72d64b527cbd2225ff0fdf2c82f9251019fbcfe78ada30e35b0c0864f92"} {"question" "q-49533" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Since $u=5x-3$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=5\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{5}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nWe also note that $x=\\frac{u+3}{5}.$\n\nComputing our limits of integration, we get\n\n| **$x$** | $0$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **$u$** | $-3$ | $7$ |\n\nWe can now solve the integral using our new variable $u,$ remembering to use the new limits of integration:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}x\\sqrt{5x-3}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{-3}^{7}\\frac{u+3}{5}\\cdot \\sqrt{u}\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{25}{\\int }_{-3}^{7}(u+3){u}^{1/2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{25}{\\int }_{-3}^{7}({u}^{3/2}+3{u}^{1/2})\\text{d}u\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/state.json" "file_sha256" "afcab72d64b527cbd2225ff0fdf2c82f9251019fbcfe78ada30e35b0c0864f92"} {"question" "q-49533" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "62ae727eded295afdb64307ce0294ab3c89743fdff2710a749a2ef6120de1370"} {"question" "q-49533" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/state.json" "file_sha256" "afcab72d64b527cbd2225ff0fdf2c82f9251019fbcfe78ada30e35b0c0864f92"} {"question" "q-49533" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{1}{25}{\\int }_{-3}^{7}({u}^{3/2}+3{u}^{1/2})\\text{d}u"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{25}{\\int }_{0}^{2}({u}^{1/2}-3{u}^{-1/2})\\text{d}u"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{5}{\\int }_{-3}^{7}\\sqrt{u}\\,\\text{d}u"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{5}{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\sqrt{u}\\,\\text{d}u"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{5}{\\int }_{3}^{7}({u}^{3/2}+3{u}^{1/2})\\text{d}u"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/state.json" "file_sha256" "afcab72d64b527cbd2225ff0fdf2c82f9251019fbcfe78ada30e35b0c0864f92"} {"question" "q-49533" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{1}{25}{\\int }_{-3}^{7}({u}^{3/2}+3{u}^{1/2})\\text{d}u"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/state.json" "file_sha256" "afcab72d64b527cbd2225ff0fdf2c82f9251019fbcfe78ada30e35b0c0864f92"} {"question" "q-348289" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{6{x}^{5}}{({x}^{3}+1)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/state.json" "file_sha256" "afcab72d64b527cbd2225ff0fdf2c82f9251019fbcfe78ada30e35b0c0864f92"} {"question" "q-348289" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let $u={x}^{3}+1.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=3{x}^{2}\\,⟹\\,3{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x=\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nWe also note that ${x}^{3}=u-1.$ \n\nComputing our limits of integration, we get\n\n| **$x$** | $0$ | $1$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **$u$** | $1$ | $2$ |\n\nWe can now solve the integral using our new variable $u,$ remembering to use the new limits of integration:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{6{x}^{5}}{({x}^{3}+1)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{2{x}^{3}}{({x}^{3}+1)^{2}}\\cdot 3{x}^{2}\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{2(u-1)}{{u}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}(\\frac{2}{u}-\\frac{2}{{u}^{2}})\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & ={(2\\operatorname{ln}⁡|u|+\\frac{2}{u})|}_{1}^{2} \\\\  & =(2\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2)+\\frac{2}{2})-(2\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1)+2) \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2)-1\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/state.json" "file_sha256" "afcab72d64b527cbd2225ff0fdf2c82f9251019fbcfe78ada30e35b0c0864f92"} {"question" "q-348289" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "62ae727eded295afdb64307ce0294ab3c89743fdff2710a749a2ef6120de1370"} {"question" "q-348289" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/state.json" "file_sha256" "afcab72d64b527cbd2225ff0fdf2c82f9251019fbcfe78ada30e35b0c0864f92"} {"question" "q-348289" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "2\\ln(2)-1"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052415/state.json" "file_sha256" "afcab72d64b527cbd2225ff0fdf2c82f9251019fbcfe78ada30e35b0c0864f92"}] "usage" {} "basis" 1758 "retractions" [] "immutable_answers" [] "immutable_fields" [] "no_history" []}
